# Netlify and Cloudflare Pages.
#
# The app is a single-page app using BrowserRouter, so /vault, /leaderboard and
# every other route exist only in the browser. A static host asked for /vault
# looks for a file called "vault", does not find one, and returns 404 — which
# is what happens on a hard reload or when a link is opened cold.
#
# 200, not 301: serve index.html AT the requested URL rather than redirecting
# to /, so the router still sees the path the player asked for.
/*    /index.html   200
